      "artist": "氏子",
      "description": "The existing southern wall is about 180.8 metres long and 2 metres high （the upper wall has been damaged）. Sandstone from Dazhi was used to build the wall using the stretcher bond under the load-bearing structure （bottom：100cm wide；upper part：85 cm wide）. The stone is about 66～120 cm long and the cross section is about 20～26 cm square. Masonry is shown as follows.",
